<https://publications.parliament.uk/pa/cm/cmallparty/260413/ahmadiyya-muslim-community.htm> <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#purpose> "The APPG brings together parliamentarians who are keen to support the work of the Ahmadiyya Muslim Community, one of Britain’s oldest established Muslim communities. It seeks to make parliamentarians and others aware of the extensive positive work of the community and to speak up on issues of persecution and extremism that Ahmadi Muslims face." <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#graph/appg-register> .
