<https://publications.parliament.uk/pa/cm/cmallparty/260413/antimicrobial-resistance.htm> <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#purpose> "The APPG exist to raise the profile of antimicrobial resistance, the need to preserve antimicrobials (including antibiotics, antivirals, antifungals, and antiparasitics) through education on their appropriate uses (including non-human uses), the lack of new treatments for infections and to help accelerate efforts to discover, research and develop new treatments." <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#graph/appg-register> .
