<https://publications.parliament.uk/pa/cm/cmallparty/260413/australia-united-kingdom-and-united-states-of-america-aukus.htm> <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#subject> "Australia, United Kingdom and United States of America (AUKUS)" <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#graph/appg-register> .
