<https://publications.parliament.uk/pa/cm/cmallparty/260413/closing-the-guantanamo-bay-detention-facility.htm> <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#purpose> "To urge the UK government to: call on the US government to finally close Guantanamo; work internationally on the urgent and humane resettlement of detainees approved for release; and call on the US government to ensure that the detainees receive adequate care for their longstanding physical and mental health needs." <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#graph/appg-register> .
