<https://publications.parliament.uk/pa/cm/cmallparty/260413/commonwealth-war-graves-commission-and-commemoration.htm> <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#purpose> "To raise awareness of the CWGC's (Commonwealth War Graves Commission) work commemorating war casualties; learn of the scope and breadth of work undertaken by CWGC in fulfilling its mission; arrange site visits to CWGC cemeteries and memorials in the UK and internationally; raise awareness of other organisations' work relevant to the commemoration of war casualties." <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#graph/appg-register> .
