<https://publications.parliament.uk/pa/cm/cmallparty/260413/digital-identity.htm> <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#purpose> "To raise awareness of Digital ID issues by providing a forum for briefings and discussion. The group will address how Digital ID systems and techniques affect consumers and businesses and its role in the smooth working of the UK economy and society. The group will promote inclusion and understanding for non-specialists." <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#graph/appg-register> .
