<https://publications.parliament.uk/pa/cm/cmallparty/260413/digital-inclusion.htm> <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#purpose> "The APPG brings together parliamentarians, industry experts and civil society to explore policies to improve digital inclusion with the aim to close the digital divide in the UK. The APPG is committed to finding and amplifying ways to enhance access to data and devices and improve digital skills." <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#graph/appg-register> .
