<https://publications.parliament.uk/pa/cm/cmallparty/260413/east-of-england.htm> <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#purpose> "To bring together East of England's MPs and Peers with elected local council leaders, directly elected mayors and police, crime and fire commissioners – as well as senior representatives from the private and third sectors - to give a strong political voice for policies which support the East of England's economy and environment and promote its potential as a place to work, study, live, visit and invest." <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#graph/appg-register> .
