<https://publications.parliament.uk/pa/cm/cmallparty/260413/fair-elections.htm> <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#purpose> "To enhance the integrity of UK democracy by: replacing First Past the Post with a proportional electoral system; eliminating dark money and undemocratic influence from politics; countering disinformation in public discourse. The APPG's goal is to deliver clean and fair elections where all votes count." <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#graph/appg-register> .
