<https://publications.parliament.uk/pa/cm/cmallparty/260413/genetic-haemochromatosis.htm> <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#purpose> "The groups' mission is to (a) raise parliamentary awareness and public understanding of Genetic Haemochromatosis (GH), its prevalence and implications; (b) drive policy change to improve the welfare of GH patients across the UK; (c) influence ministers, parliamentarians, government bodies, policy-makers and NHS representatives to improve patient pathways through the UK healthcare and support systems." <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#graph/appg-register> .
