<https://publications.parliament.uk/pa/cm/cmallparty/260413/lancashire.htm> <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#category> "Subject Group" <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#graph/appg-register> .
<https://publications.parliament.uk/pa/cm/cmallparty/260413/lancashire.htm> <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#purpose> "The APPG will provide a forum to champion the county’s interests, drive investment and create growth opportunities that benefit local people and businesses. The APPG will explore the long-term success of existing committed investments into Lancashire and look to tell the story of Lancashire in Parliament and to the world." <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#graph/appg-register> .
