<https://publications.parliament.uk/pa/cm/cmallparty/260413/new-towns.htm> <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#purpose> "To celebrate the UK’s New Towns, identify common challenges and make the case for investment and sustainable growth. This APPG will examine how to best support the needs of the 2.8 million people already living in new towns and consider the needs of the residents of the future. Learning the lessons from past new towns in championing and supporting the creation of more new towns." <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#graph/appg-register> .
