<https://publications.parliament.uk/pa/cm/cmallparty/260413/night-time-economy.htm> <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#purpose> "To provide a cross-party voice to champion nightlife’s cultural and economic importance. To promote policy opportunities and solutions, working in partnership with cross-sector stakeholders. To support and unlock equitable growth through the Night Time Economy (NTE). To protect and support NTE spaces and ecosystems from immediate threats." <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#graph/appg-register> .
