<https://publications.parliament.uk/pa/cm/cmallparty/260413/outdoor-learning.htm> <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#purpose> "Through outdoor learning, we support the development of sustainable behaviours in children, young people and adults which lead to personal happiness, health & wellbeing and self-fulfilment; preparedness for work and economic independence; and readiness for active stewardship and citizenship. Building on distinguished heritage - responding to the challenges of today." <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#graph/appg-register> .
