<https://publications.parliament.uk/pa/cm/cmallparty/260413/sustainable-finance.htm> <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#purpose> "The APPG’s aim is to develop and advocate for policies which promote environmentally responsible financial practices while ensuring economic stability. Its focus is not only on driving long-term investment in sustainability but also on fostering a financial system that is transparent and accountable. We are non-partisan and work to build consensus across the political spectrum to create a greener, more equitable future." <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#graph/appg-register> .
