<https://publications.parliament.uk/pa/cm/cmallparty/260413/warm-homes.htm> <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#purpose> "The APPG supports parliamentarians to accelerate the eradication of cold homes. The Group seeks to build cross-party consensus by convening policymakers with frontline advocates, industry, and health experts to ensure every household can afford to live in a warm home." <https://forgetmenot.example/transparency#graph/appg-register> .
